      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5a9fb18f6c994d2a9d44012a|full_name}: Must be when using procedural texture generation then. Could you try taking a procedural texture from substance and putting it on an avatar? That usually gives me a loading loop in game.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
    {
      "__v": 0,
      "_id": "5c994c57cca0347f2f37709a",
